# gains: defaults
# why: defaults: restore API/pid.c firmware default gains without requiring power-cycle (docs/agent/lab-friction-2026-10-15.md A6)
# D2: in-flight ES auto-tune of the xy position cascade (livetune loop=pos, CMA-ES): outer locx/locy Kp, Kd and inner
# locxs/locys Kp, Kd, the same values on x and y (idx 24-35, Ki not written). One candidate per 8.5 s window: write the
# gains, settle 2.5 s, a 0.3-2 Hz 20 deg/s chirp on pitch (x) or roll (y) as the disturbance, score the position error.
# Starts from the firmware defaults (locx 0.8/4.0, locxs 3.0/6.0), trust 0.6 (reaches C3); every end writes the defaults
# back, the best gains are only reported (8081 says the summary line). fusion 2: each chirp re-zeroes the flow origin.
# Budget 85 s = baseline + 4 candidates on x, then on y. All values PROPOSED. Plan: docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-16.md
campaign lab-d-livetune-pos
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
slow 50 nn4 xy_ctrl mrac_3l mrac_theta ekf_states estimator_truth thrust_model optical_flow takeoff_gate mrac_shadow
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5
hold 2
livetune loop=pos axes=[x,y] budget_s=85
hold 1
land
